[{"title":"题画八首 其三","author":"何吾驺","text":"前溪断尽接深松，日暮疏疏精舍钟。\n欲写閒心度秋水，布帆吹去两三峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画八首 其四","author":"何吾驺","text":"大风吹山山欲倒，千树万树皆如扫。\n波涛压屋不惊鸥，天外閒情仗三老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画八首 其五","author":"何吾驺","text":"杨柳千枝独一心，临歧握别复沈吟。\n人生踪迹浑无著，明日扁舟何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画八首 其六","author":"何吾驺","text":"结屋山陂每住船，寒流不饵意悠然。\n秋风树树堪同醉，莫笑长竿锁暮烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画八首 其七","author":"何吾驺","text":"松响寒涛壑喷霞，万山烟雨落灯花。\n故人昨夜沧江约，独自临风怅碧纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画八首 其八","author":"何吾驺","text":"閒囊绿绮访同心，石磴崎岖积翠深。\n只在前峰追不见，高山流水送希音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"米友石病中折红梨花见遗索题二首 其一","author":"何吾驺","text":"向来冷艳送馀香，